1
00:01:31,740 --> 00:01:34,930
[In My Prime]

2
00:01:35,370 --> 00:01:37,710
[Episode 4]

3
00:01:38,070 --> 00:01:39,920
Let's actively respond
to the national call

4
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:41,759
and promote the re-employment
and entrepreneurship

5
00:01:41,759 --> 00:01:42,890
of laid-off workers

6
00:01:43,039 --> 00:01:44,479
to inject vitality into

7
00:01:44,479 --> 00:01:46,740
China's job market and private economy.

8
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:53,979
Have you heard?

9
00:01:54,150 --> 00:01:55,350
The entire sixth group,

10
00:01:55,350 --> 00:01:56,950
namely the one Li Dazhu is in,

11
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:58,560
was called in for a talk.

12
00:01:59,229 --> 00:02:00,200
Really?

13
00:02:00,590 --> 00:02:02,850
That group was rated advanced last year.

14
00:02:02,930 --> 00:02:04,200
Well then, Li Dazhu must have

15
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:05,310
made a fuss over it, didn't he?

16
00:02:05,310 --> 00:02:05,920
Yeah.

17
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,820
But what do we dare say?

18
00:02:08,910 --> 00:02:09,800
I've heard

19
00:02:10,030 --> 00:02:11,000
that our mine has long been

20
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,460
unable to afford payroll.

21
00:02:12,570 --> 00:02:15,230
It's been patching one hole
by digging another.

22
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,150
The list of laid-off workers

23
00:02:16,150 --> 00:02:17,079
this time mainly

24
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:19,310
consists of lower-level employees like us.

25
00:02:19,310 --> 00:02:20,850
If both husband and wife work here,

26
00:02:20,850 --> 00:02:23,050
one of them must take early retirement.

27
00:02:24,310 --> 00:02:24,800
Aihua,

28
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:26,490
why are you so quiet?

29
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:29,160
Have you figured out a plan already?

30
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:32,340
I'm only an ordinary citizen.

31
00:02:32,470 --> 00:02:34,070
What good plans could I have?

32
00:02:40,910 --> 00:02:42,970
Laid-off workers get severance pay.

33
00:02:44,030 --> 00:02:45,090
Besides, it's good

34
00:02:45,310 --> 00:02:47,040
to never go down the mine again.

35
00:02:47,870 --> 00:02:49,670
It spares us from fear and worry.

36
00:02:50,570 --> 00:02:52,829
Aihua always takes a positive attitude.

37
00:02:53,310 --> 00:02:55,240
You make it sound like nothing,

38
00:02:55,260 --> 00:02:55,730
Aihua.

39
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:58,030
But what do you think

40
00:02:58,220 --> 00:02:59,950
people like us can do out there?

41
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:03,960
We've been miners for over 10 years,

42
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,610
covered in dirt every day.

43
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:08,630
I think it's actually a good thing

44
00:03:08,630 --> 00:03:10,030
to switch to a decent job.

45
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:13,030
Fine then.

46
00:03:14,670 --> 00:03:15,400
It is getting

47
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:17,630
warmer and warmer.

48
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,560
I've got you both

49
00:03:19,590 --> 00:03:20,800
thinner sweaters.

50
00:03:21,190 --> 00:03:23,150
Don't take yours off during PE class.

51
00:03:23,150 --> 00:03:24,590
You'll be in trouble if you catch a cold.

52
00:03:24,590 --> 00:03:25,079
Mom.

53
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:26,680
is that sweater

54
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:28,280
my brother's hand-me-down?

55
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:29,740
I'm not wearing it.

56
00:03:29,900 --> 00:03:30,960
I want a new one.

57
00:03:32,630 --> 00:03:34,829
I unraveled his and knitted one for you.

58
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:36,400
It's just as good as new,

59
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:38,310
made with top-quality wool.

60
00:03:39,030 --> 00:03:40,000
I treasured it so much that I didn't knit

61
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:41,000
gloves with it for your dad.

62
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:42,360
How can you be so picky?

63
00:03:42,630 --> 00:03:44,280
Mom, you're playing favorites.

64
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:46,150
I'm an elementary school student now.

65
00:03:46,150 --> 00:03:48,079
If I wear my brother's old sweater,

66
00:03:48,079 --> 00:03:49,560
my classmates will laugh at me.

67
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,470
Fine then.

68
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,560
I'll get you a new one.

69
00:03:52,700 --> 00:03:53,680
You two are impossible.

70
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:55,010
It's like I owe you both.

71
00:03:57,030 --> 00:03:57,690
Go to sleep.

72
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:08,360
Get up!

73
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:09,200
Get up.

74
00:04:09,430 --> 00:04:10,590
Let me check on your face.

75
00:04:10,590 --> 00:04:11,960
How did you get so sunburned?

76
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:12,560
Get up now.

77
00:04:14,910 --> 00:04:16,040
How did this happen?

78
00:04:16,510 --> 00:04:18,000
This morning, you had your hat

79
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:19,290
and everything on properly.

80
00:04:19,290 --> 00:04:19,890
How did...

81
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:21,450
your face get so sunburned?

82
00:04:21,880 --> 00:04:23,210
Did you attend PE class?

83
00:04:24,570 --> 00:04:26,370
I've told your teacher about it.

84
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:29,950
Why didn't you look after
your little sister?

85
00:04:29,950 --> 00:04:30,850
Look at her face.

86
00:04:30,850 --> 00:04:32,380
How did it get so sunburned?

87
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:36,190
This is indeed a bit serious.

88
00:04:36,190 --> 00:04:37,480
Maybe you should lose that hair clip
and stop trying

89
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:39,409
to look pretty in the next few days.

90
00:04:39,750 --> 00:04:40,610
What hair clip?

91
00:04:41,500 --> 00:04:43,659
F-Forget I said anything.

92
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:44,750
I fell asleep already.

93
00:04:44,750 --> 00:04:45,950
I didn't speak a word.

94
00:04:46,870 --> 00:04:47,730
What hair clip?

95
00:04:47,830 --> 00:04:48,430
Show me.

96
00:04:52,750 --> 00:04:54,280
Will you hand it over or not?

97
00:04:55,620 --> 00:04:56,390
Give it to me now,

98
00:04:56,390 --> 00:04:58,520
or I'll talk to your teacher tomorrow.

99
00:05:09,630 --> 00:05:10,830
Who gave these to you?

100
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:17,240
Look at these.

101
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:18,500
A good job by Dongfang,

102
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:20,140
that dear friend of yours.

103
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:20,770
What now?

104
00:05:20,830 --> 00:05:22,190
Our daughter didn't put on her hat

105
00:05:22,190 --> 00:05:23,510
s-so as to look pretty.

106
00:05:23,590 --> 00:05:24,950
Her face is all sunburned.

107
00:05:24,950 --> 00:05:25,750
Go take a look.

108
00:05:26,750 --> 00:05:27,410
Seriously,

109
00:05:27,410 --> 00:05:27,920
can you

110
00:05:27,940 --> 00:05:29,140
talk to Dongfang?

111
00:05:29,370 --> 00:05:30,430
Before he buys or gifts us

112
00:05:30,430 --> 00:05:31,680
anything in the future,

113
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:33,940
he should first ask if it's suited for us.

114
00:05:36,140 --> 00:05:36,750
Will you say it or not?

115
00:05:36,750 --> 00:05:37,880
If you don't, I will.

116
00:05:39,080 --> 00:05:41,480
It's inappropriate for you
to say it to him.

117
00:05:41,630 --> 00:05:42,960
I'll talk to him later.

118
00:05:43,190 --> 00:05:44,560
He's not home today, for he is

119
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:45,620
working overtime.

120
00:05:45,630 --> 00:05:46,690
Working overtime?

121
00:05:47,159 --> 00:05:48,420
At this hour of the day?

122
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:49,960
Just some mine business.

123
00:05:51,190 --> 00:05:52,070
Are they discussing

124
00:05:52,070 --> 00:05:53,630
the list of layoffs?

125
00:05:54,370 --> 00:05:55,310
I told you to ask him about it.

126
00:05:55,310 --> 00:05:56,170
Have you asked?

127
00:05:56,430 --> 00:05:58,430
He's in charge of HR. What did he say?

128
00:05:58,960 --> 00:05:59,720
You know

129
00:05:59,750 --> 00:06:01,010
what Dongfang is like.

130
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:03,040
If I'm really on the list,

131
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:04,630
talking to him won't be of help.

132
00:06:04,630 --> 00:06:05,400
It's fine.

133
00:06:05,430 --> 00:06:07,160
This is not the end of the world.

134
00:06:07,880 --> 00:06:08,870
At this critical moment,

135
00:06:08,870 --> 00:06:10,470
we had better not offend him.

136
00:06:12,070 --> 00:06:12,920
His family and ours

137
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:14,600
are like one.

138
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,650
Give him some credit, alright?

139
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,290
Listen to yourself.

140
00:06:19,330 --> 00:06:20,600
You always say his family

141
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:21,920
and ours are like one.

142
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:24,280
But you never know what goes on
in one's mind.

143
00:06:24,280 --> 00:06:25,430
Only when something serious happens

144
00:06:25,430 --> 00:06:26,360
will you find out

145
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:27,360
how much

146
00:06:27,390 --> 00:06:28,590
you truly mean to him.

147
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:31,100
What gives you this much confidence?

148
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:32,010
For God's sake.

149
00:06:32,510 --> 00:06:34,630
I took over my dad's job
and started working

150
00:06:34,630 --> 00:06:35,890
at the mine in my teens.

151
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:37,170
Over these decades,

152
00:06:37,870 --> 00:06:40,200
I've made some contributions, haven't I?

153
00:06:40,310 --> 00:06:42,490
If the higher-ups still have a conscience,

154
00:06:42,490 --> 00:06:43,430
given my seniority,

155
00:06:43,430 --> 00:06:44,430
others should be fired

156
00:06:44,430 --> 00:06:45,430
before I am.

157
00:06:46,630 --> 00:06:48,830
It takes a lot of money to raise our kids.

158
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:51,000
Our daughter's health supplements

159
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,330
cost a massive fortune.

160
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:54,510
I really can't imagine

161
00:06:54,510 --> 00:06:55,210
what will happen

162
00:06:55,210 --> 00:06:57,010
to our family if you are laid off.

163
00:07:03,950 --> 00:07:04,750
Mr. Cao.

164
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,510
Qinglian, you busy?

165
00:07:07,510 --> 00:07:09,800
I just made some sprout-stuffed buns.

166
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:11,730
Here you are.

167
00:07:12,430 --> 00:07:13,680
It's Cao Xin's favorite.

168
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:15,140
I'll let you in on a secret.

169
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:17,140
Our entire family enjoys it.

170
00:07:17,270 --> 00:07:18,160
That's great.

171
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:19,720
Qinglian, look.

172
00:07:19,870 --> 00:07:21,400
I bought a lot of groceries.

173
00:07:21,430 --> 00:07:23,290
Bring Aihua and your kids to our place

174
00:07:23,290 --> 00:07:24,530
for dinner tonight.

175
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:26,560
I'd hate to put you through trouble.

176
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:29,270
Is Dongfang not home yet?

177
00:07:29,270 --> 00:07:29,930
No, not yet.

178
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:30,950
God knows

179
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:33,070
what's going on at the mine recently.

180
00:07:33,070 --> 00:07:35,120
Dongfang is occupied all the time.

181
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:39,460
Do you need him for something?

182
00:07:41,510 --> 00:07:42,510
Please come over.

183
00:07:43,630 --> 00:07:44,190
Mr. Cao.

184
00:07:45,270 --> 00:07:46,610
Lately at the mine,

185
00:07:46,640 --> 00:07:48,770
hasn't there been talk about layoffs?

186
00:07:49,390 --> 00:07:51,390
I'm a bit worried.

187
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:52,510
I'm wondering

188
00:07:52,510 --> 00:07:53,680
if Aihua is on the list

189
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:55,190
of employees to be laid off.

190
00:07:55,190 --> 00:07:55,990
I understand.

191
00:07:56,510 --> 00:07:58,720
Could you please

192
00:07:58,720 --> 00:07:59,830
ask Dongfang about it?

193
00:07:59,830 --> 00:08:00,720
Qinglian,

194
00:08:01,830 --> 00:08:02,720
don't you know

195
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:03,980
what Dongfang is like?

196
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:06,120
He never says a word

197
00:08:06,140 --> 00:08:07,810
about work at home.

198
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,130
He's tight-lipped.

199
00:08:09,310 --> 00:08:10,440
But don't you worry.

200
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:11,560
Who is Aihua to us?

201
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:12,850
No matter who gets laid off,

202
00:08:12,850 --> 00:08:13,850
it won't be Aihua.

203
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:15,170
Let me handle it.

204
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:17,360
Oh, listen to myself.

205
00:08:17,630 --> 00:08:18,600
Dongfang knows

206
00:08:18,770 --> 00:08:19,890
this matter

207
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,270
better than any of us.

208
00:08:21,430 --> 00:08:22,240
So rest assured.

209
00:08:22,240 --> 00:08:23,830
I'm relieved to hear that.

210
00:08:23,850 --> 00:08:24,850
Just don't worry.

211
00:08:24,950 --> 00:08:25,560
Tonight,

212
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:26,870
bring the kids and Aihua

213
00:08:26,870 --> 00:08:27,770
over for dinner.

214
00:08:27,770 --> 00:08:28,100
Okay.

215
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:31,830
My father said

216
00:08:32,840 --> 00:08:35,700
Qinglian came to my place,
asking for a word with me.

217
00:08:38,750 --> 00:08:40,679
She always worries about nothing.

218
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:46,680
What happened to your mouth?

219
00:08:48,510 --> 00:08:50,110
Nothing, just a canker sore.

220
00:08:50,910 --> 00:08:52,170
Don't you fret.

221
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:54,200
I haven't got the list yet.

222
00:08:59,750 --> 00:09:00,680
In my opinion...

223
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:03,650
being laid off is not that serious.

224
00:09:04,150 --> 00:09:05,280
What's the big deal?

225
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:06,600
After all these years,

226
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:08,400
I've gotten tired of this place.

227
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:10,000
I've thought it through.

228
00:09:11,750 --> 00:09:12,880
When the time comes,

229
00:09:13,790 --> 00:09:16,600
I'll go to Guangzhou or Shenzhen

230
00:09:17,230 --> 00:09:18,890
to strive for a huge business.

231
00:09:18,910 --> 00:09:19,920
By the time I come back,

232
00:09:19,920 --> 00:09:20,780
perhaps I'll be

233
00:09:21,390 --> 00:09:22,790
wearing big sunglasses,

234
00:09:23,030 --> 00:09:24,000
and a necklace—

235
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,200
I mean a gold one,

236
00:09:26,030 --> 00:09:27,600
and hold a briefcase in my left arm

237
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:29,400
and a cell phone in my right hand.

238
00:09:29,440 --> 00:09:31,030
In that case, even you will have to

239
00:09:31,030 --> 00:09:31,890
call me Boss Qi.

240
00:09:32,430 --> 00:09:34,070
I truly look forward to that.

241
00:09:34,420 --> 00:09:35,510
One day in the future,

242
00:09:35,510 --> 00:09:36,760
I'd really love to see

243
00:09:36,790 --> 00:09:38,120
what Boss Qi looks like.

244
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:45,670
Who was it that

245
00:09:46,510 --> 00:09:49,150
stood on top of the mine and said:

246
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:52,330
"I am to become the mine director!"

247
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:54,340
"I am to become the Party secretary!"

248
00:09:54,340 --> 00:09:55,440
Yes, the Party secretary.

249
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:55,970
However,

250
00:09:56,270 --> 00:09:58,130
you fell even before you finished

251
00:09:58,840 --> 00:09:59,840
those sentences.

252
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:01,670
You took a big tumble.

253
00:10:03,630 --> 00:10:04,360
Dongfang.

254
00:10:05,510 --> 00:10:07,190
Let me tell you something—

255
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:08,160
it's not a lie.

256
00:10:08,270 --> 00:10:08,910
I am...

257
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:10,910
truly...

258
00:10:11,850 --> 00:10:12,880
hoping

259
00:10:12,910 --> 00:10:14,200
to work at the mine

260
00:10:15,030 --> 00:10:16,290
for the rest of my life.

261
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:18,840
I understand. I do.

262
00:10:21,960 --> 00:10:23,150
I am deeply attached

263
00:10:24,280 --> 00:10:25,680
to the mine emotionally.

264
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:29,870
Dongfang,

265
00:10:31,390 --> 00:10:32,150
you see,

266
00:10:33,910 --> 00:10:35,770
the mine in Qingwu is so gigantic.

267
00:10:39,440 --> 00:10:40,390
Wasn't it said before

268
00:10:40,390 --> 00:10:43,190
that the mining would last
for three generations?

269
00:10:43,840 --> 00:10:45,900
How come the work's finished so soon?

270
00:10:46,790 --> 00:10:48,520
I know nothing but to mine coal.

271
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:53,650
I've dedicated all my prime years
to the mine.

272
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:57,510
You can't just toss me aside

273
00:10:57,510 --> 00:10:58,840
when you feel like it.

274
00:11:14,630 --> 00:11:15,490
Please come in.

275
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:19,440
Dongfang?

276
00:11:20,440 --> 00:11:21,600
You're still here at this hour.

277
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:22,840
Do you need something?

278
00:11:22,840 --> 00:11:23,440
Yes.

279
00:11:23,690 --> 00:11:24,720
How much did you drink?

280
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:25,290
You reek of alcohol.

281
00:11:25,290 --> 00:11:25,910
Not much.

282
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:28,320
Not very much.

283
00:11:29,870 --> 00:11:30,470
Director,

284
00:11:30,670 --> 00:11:33,440
I heard the mine

285
00:11:34,390 --> 00:11:37,080
is downsizing.

286
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:39,150
Is Qi Aihua

287
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:41,030
on the layoff list?

288
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:44,960
Dongfang,

289
00:11:45,390 --> 00:11:46,720
according to the rules,

290
00:11:47,090 --> 00:11:48,000
I shouldn't tell you about it

291
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:49,000
before the announcement.

292
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:50,150
I know. I get that.

293
00:11:50,870 --> 00:11:51,670
I'm just...

294
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:54,000
trying to tell you something,

295
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:54,600
Director.

296
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:56,480
Qi Aihua

297
00:11:56,760 --> 00:11:58,360
is a veteran employee

298
00:11:58,390 --> 00:11:59,550
at the mine.

299
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:01,080
He has made many,

300
00:12:01,630 --> 00:12:04,120
many contributions to this place.

301
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:05,320
Besides,

302
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:08,150
his family is truly in difficulty.

303
00:12:08,730 --> 00:12:10,640
He cannot lose his job.

304
00:12:10,670 --> 00:12:12,670
If you dismiss him
simply for falling asleep,

305
00:12:12,670 --> 00:12:14,120
isn't it just making a fuss

306
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:15,420
over nothing?

307
00:12:15,790 --> 00:12:16,390
Dongfang.

308
00:12:16,790 --> 00:12:17,910
even the closest relationship

309
00:12:17,910 --> 00:12:19,770
can't be compared to a secure job.

310
00:12:20,330 --> 00:12:22,460
How about you get laid off in his stead?

311
00:12:28,480 --> 00:12:28,930
Cao Si!

312
00:12:31,870 --> 00:12:33,130
I want you to have this.

313
00:12:33,150 --> 00:12:34,010
I don't want it.

314
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:34,930
Just take it.

315
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:46,750
How am I so nervous
at the sight of Cao Si?

316
00:12:46,750 --> 00:12:47,160
Let's go.

317
00:12:47,160 --> 00:12:47,960
I'm in a good mood today.

318
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:48,960
I'll treat you to breakfast.

319
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:49,240
Great!

320
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:49,600
Let's go!

321
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:49,960
Go!

322
00:12:50,030 --> 00:12:51,030
Time for breakfast!

323
00:12:51,030 --> 00:12:51,750
Let's head for it!

324
00:12:51,750 --> 00:12:52,410
Breakfast!

325
00:12:53,840 --> 00:12:54,840
Cao Si! Cao Si!

326
00:12:55,420 --> 00:12:57,020
I'll walk to school with you!

327
00:12:58,320 --> 00:12:59,120
Throw this away for me.

328
00:12:59,120 --> 00:13:00,150
I'm going to be late for this morning's

329
00:13:00,150 --> 00:13:01,080
dance training.

330
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:04,320
You don't want any

331
00:13:04,320 --> 00:13:05,380
of this tasty food?

332
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:07,180
It's good. I'm just browsing around.

333
00:13:07,180 --> 00:13:07,850
Okay.

334
00:13:09,320 --> 00:13:10,080
Lingzhi!

335
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:14,030
-Qinglian.
-You just got off work?

336
00:13:14,030 --> 00:13:15,030
You bought a fish?

337
00:13:15,910 --> 00:13:17,770
Aihua works hard down in the mine.

338
00:13:17,790 --> 00:13:19,200
I thought I'd buy him a fish

339
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,060
for nutrition.

340
00:13:20,270 --> 00:13:21,750
I also bought pig blood for the good

341
00:13:21,750 --> 00:13:22,480
of his lungs.

342
00:13:23,630 --> 00:13:24,200
No wonder

343
00:13:24,390 --> 00:13:26,020
you can be in charge of the household.

344
00:13:26,020 --> 00:13:26,950
I can never be

345
00:13:26,990 --> 00:13:28,400
as optimistic as you are.

346
00:13:28,790 --> 00:13:30,550
A serious matter just happened.

347
00:13:30,550 --> 00:13:32,390
And you're still going to
cook fish and stuff.

348
00:13:32,390 --> 00:13:34,480
You treat your husband so well.

349
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:36,030
What happened?

350
00:13:37,320 --> 00:13:38,270
You have no idea?

351
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:39,300
This...

352
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:42,000
The list

353
00:13:42,030 --> 00:13:43,830
of laid-off mine workers is out.

354
00:13:43,870 --> 00:13:45,400
Your husband Aihua is on it.

355
00:13:48,030 --> 00:13:48,790
Qinglian,

356
00:13:49,390 --> 00:13:52,150
I heard someone complained about him,

357
00:13:52,550 --> 00:13:54,440
s-saying that he caused

358
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:55,700
major safety hazards,

359
00:13:56,030 --> 00:13:56,730
and

360
00:13:57,390 --> 00:13:59,010
t-that he slept at the mine entrance

361
00:13:59,010 --> 00:13:59,940
several times.

362
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:02,050
He's been used as a bad example.

363
00:14:04,060 --> 00:14:04,700
Qinglian!

364
00:14:09,200 --> 00:14:10,200
Please let me through.

365
00:14:10,200 --> 00:14:11,060
Let me through!

366
00:14:11,550 --> 00:14:13,320
Come on, make way, please.

367
00:14:13,870 --> 00:14:14,390
Make way!

368
00:14:14,390 --> 00:14:15,250
Let me through.

369
00:14:15,480 --> 00:14:16,790
Excuse me.

370
00:14:27,900 --> 00:14:29,560
[Qi Aihua]

371
00:14:43,390 --> 00:14:44,250
Let me through!

372
00:14:45,440 --> 00:14:45,970
Make way!

373
00:14:49,550 --> 00:14:50,750
Qinglian, Qinglian!

374
00:14:51,390 --> 00:14:52,790
The director isn't here.

375
00:14:53,360 --> 00:14:53,960
Qinglian!

376
00:14:59,030 --> 00:14:59,630
Qinglian!

377
00:15:00,150 --> 00:15:00,790
Qinglian!

378
00:15:01,250 --> 00:15:02,310
Would you stay out?

379
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:03,870
Look, the director is busy right now.

380
00:15:03,870 --> 00:15:04,530
Who are you?

381
00:15:04,690 --> 00:15:06,760
She's Qi Aihua's wife.

382
00:15:07,130 --> 00:15:08,480
Qi Aihua is on the layoff list

383
00:15:08,480 --> 00:15:09,550
this time, isn't he?

384
00:15:09,550 --> 00:15:10,240
So, she...

385
00:15:14,030 --> 00:15:14,560
Comrade,

386
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:15,460
listen,

387
00:15:15,870 --> 00:15:17,200
I know how you must feel.

388
00:15:17,510 --> 00:15:18,770
It breaks my heart too.

389
00:15:19,260 --> 00:15:20,440
Before I was transferred

390
00:15:20,440 --> 00:15:21,390
to the mine,

391
00:15:21,590 --> 00:15:22,880
Aihua and his fellow workers

392
00:15:22,880 --> 00:15:23,750
had been working here

393
00:15:23,750 --> 00:15:24,750
for many years.

394
00:15:26,150 --> 00:15:27,010
It's fair to say

395
00:15:27,030 --> 00:15:28,090
that without them,

396
00:15:28,120 --> 00:15:28,750
Qingwu No. 3 Mine

397
00:15:28,750 --> 00:15:30,350
wouldn't be the way it is now.

398
00:15:31,630 --> 00:15:33,840
However, no breakthrough
without breaking down.

399
00:15:33,840 --> 00:15:35,390
The country needs to develop,

400
00:15:35,390 --> 00:15:36,990
and the coal mining sector must advance.

401
00:15:36,990 --> 00:15:39,320
Shouldn't we, as workers,
act in the nation's

402
00:15:39,320 --> 00:15:40,240
best interests?

403
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:40,840
Director,

404
00:15:40,870 --> 00:15:41,630
I'm hardly

405
00:15:41,630 --> 00:15:42,870
as noble as you are.

406
00:15:42,870 --> 00:15:43,240
Wait.

407
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:44,970
We are just ordinary citizens.

408
00:15:45,030 --> 00:15:45,600
The walnuts...

409
00:15:45,600 --> 00:15:46,500
Without this stuff,

410
00:15:46,500 --> 00:15:47,320
how do we live?

411
00:15:47,510 --> 00:15:47,720
You're...

412
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:48,320
I'm telling you,

413
00:15:48,320 --> 00:15:49,790
we need all of these.

414
00:15:49,910 --> 00:15:50,910
Wait. You...

415
00:15:51,030 --> 00:15:51,480
Why...

416
00:15:53,030 --> 00:15:53,600
What...

417
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:56,550
The water...

418
00:15:56,550 --> 00:15:57,960
You can live without this,

419
00:15:57,960 --> 00:15:58,870
but we can't.

420
00:15:59,720 --> 00:16:00,250
No, wait.

421
00:16:01,590 --> 00:16:03,160
What kind of person is that?

422
00:16:26,980 --> 00:16:28,240
You already know, huh?

423
00:16:34,960 --> 00:16:35,790
Know what?

424
00:16:38,950 --> 00:16:40,170
You were reported for sleeping

425
00:16:40,170 --> 00:16:41,370
at the mine entrance.

426
00:16:42,720 --> 00:16:44,080
You've been laid off.

427
00:16:53,630 --> 00:16:54,430
Who said that?

428
00:16:55,550 --> 00:16:57,120
And you're asking who said that?

429
00:16:57,120 --> 00:16:59,050
It's known to everyone at the mine.

430
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:02,320
Who saw you sleep?

431
00:17:05,349 --> 00:17:06,750
Who caught you in the act?

432
00:17:08,240 --> 00:17:08,880
Aihua!

433
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:10,640
Aihua!

434
00:17:11,109 --> 00:17:11,510
Aihua!

435
00:17:12,270 --> 00:17:14,030
How could you be asleep at this hour?

436
00:17:14,030 --> 00:17:15,560
At the mouth of the pit, too?

437
00:17:19,020 --> 00:17:19,790
No way.

438
00:17:22,349 --> 00:17:23,400
I did it only once.

439
00:17:24,920 --> 00:17:26,050
So who saw you there?

440
00:17:30,720 --> 00:17:31,320
Dongfang.

441
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:36,460
He promised me

442
00:17:36,460 --> 00:17:37,860
he wouldn't tell anyone.

443
00:17:50,010 --> 00:17:51,170
And you believed him

444
00:17:51,200 --> 00:17:52,530
just because he said so?

445
00:17:52,750 --> 00:17:54,550
He can even desert his family
when he's hungry for power.

446
00:17:54,550 --> 00:17:56,080
Why would he care about you?

447
00:17:58,400 --> 00:17:59,830
Dongfang is not like that.

448
00:17:59,830 --> 00:18:00,960
Then what is he like?

449
00:18:01,370 --> 00:18:02,160
Aren't you forced out

450
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:03,090
of your post now?

451
00:18:14,750 --> 00:18:15,880
Where are you going?

452
00:18:19,550 --> 00:18:20,150
Dongfang.

453
00:18:20,880 --> 00:18:21,480
Qinglian?

454
00:18:21,750 --> 00:18:23,010
Come on in, take a seat.

455
00:18:23,200 --> 00:18:23,550
Sit.

456
00:18:23,570 --> 00:18:24,250
I'm not going in.

457
00:18:24,250 --> 00:18:25,510
I'll speak right here.

458
00:18:28,200 --> 00:18:30,460
Dongfang, we've been friends for years.

459
00:18:30,550 --> 00:18:32,400
It's said a close neighbor
is better than a distant relative.

460
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:33,240
Years ago, you saved

461
00:18:33,240 --> 00:18:34,200
Aihua at the mine.

462
00:18:34,200 --> 00:18:34,880
We've always kept

463
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:36,200
your great kindness in mind.

464
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:37,310
Try putting yourself in our shoes.

465
00:18:37,310 --> 00:18:38,310
You see

466
00:18:38,310 --> 00:18:39,370
how we treat Qi Shi.

467
00:18:40,350 --> 00:18:41,960
Due to Qishi's health condition,

468
00:18:41,960 --> 00:18:43,160
especially her eyes,

469
00:18:43,830 --> 00:18:44,920
we have to supply her

470
00:18:44,920 --> 00:18:46,680
with plenty of vitamin supplements.

471
00:18:46,680 --> 00:18:48,240
Aihua and I have been constantly
upset and scorned

472
00:18:48,240 --> 00:18:49,200
because of Qi Shi.

473
00:18:49,200 --> 00:18:50,080
But we've never

474
00:18:50,480 --> 00:18:51,110
said a single word

475
00:18:51,110 --> 00:18:52,200
of complaint to you, have we?

476
00:18:52,200 --> 00:18:52,510
Right.

477
00:18:52,510 --> 00:18:53,440
We keep all the grievances

478
00:18:53,440 --> 00:18:54,240
to ourselves.

479
00:18:55,270 --> 00:18:56,000
Now, our family is

480
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:57,130
in utter adversity.

481
00:18:57,920 --> 00:18:59,980
We're not asking you to give us a hand,

482
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:02,260
but please don't kick us when we're down.

483
00:19:03,750 --> 00:19:05,000
Qinglian, come on, sit down.

484
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:07,110
Take a seat and have a nice talk,
shall we?

485
00:19:07,110 --> 00:19:07,710
Qinglian,

486
00:19:08,480 --> 00:19:09,200
stop it.

487
00:19:10,550 --> 00:19:11,270
Go home now.

488
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:41,600
Dongfang,

489
00:19:43,590 --> 00:19:44,990
everyone at the mine says

490
00:19:46,550 --> 00:19:47,950
it was you who reported me

491
00:19:48,030 --> 00:19:49,430
and caused my dismissal.

492
00:19:50,400 --> 00:19:51,510
I did do wrong by sleeping

493
00:19:51,510 --> 00:19:52,570
during work hours.

494
00:19:53,830 --> 00:19:55,560
But that's a different matter.

495
00:19:56,230 --> 00:19:57,760
You are like a brother to me.

496
00:19:58,590 --> 00:19:59,720
Now, I'd like to know

497
00:20:00,480 --> 00:20:01,640
if you reported me.

498
00:20:12,030 --> 00:20:12,630
Dongfang,

499
00:20:16,300 --> 00:20:18,030
I wouldn't be surprised

500
00:20:18,160 --> 00:20:19,550
if you did report me.

501
00:20:20,880 --> 00:20:21,880
Because I know

502
00:20:22,750 --> 00:20:24,510
you are an upright person.

503
00:20:26,350 --> 00:20:27,440
I understand this is the principle

504
00:20:27,440 --> 00:20:29,300
you stick to in everything you do.

505
00:20:32,680 --> 00:20:34,750
But I am your closest friend.

506
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:38,660
We are practically brothers.

507
00:20:46,650 --> 00:20:47,720
Ever since you saved me

508
00:20:47,720 --> 00:20:48,680
at the mine,

509
00:20:50,160 --> 00:20:51,960
I've considered you my brother.

510
00:20:52,480 --> 00:20:53,830
Then, your family and mine

511
00:20:53,830 --> 00:20:54,890
swapped children.

512
00:20:55,450 --> 00:20:56,210
In my heart,

513
00:20:56,240 --> 00:20:57,400
I truly think of

514
00:20:57,420 --> 00:20:58,900
our two families as one.

515
00:21:03,510 --> 00:21:04,110
Dongfang.

516
00:21:06,400 --> 00:21:07,460
On today's matter,

517
00:21:08,590 --> 00:21:09,590
if it were me,

518
00:21:12,440 --> 00:21:13,840
I would've protected you

519
00:21:13,920 --> 00:21:15,380
even at the cost of my life,

520
00:21:17,110 --> 00:21:18,830
let alone a job.

521
00:21:19,200 --> 00:21:20,330
That means nothing.

522
00:21:26,030 --> 00:21:27,310
Mom, I'm home!

523
00:21:32,110 --> 00:21:32,640
Mom,

524
00:21:32,890 --> 00:21:33,750
why did you leave the fish

525
00:21:33,750 --> 00:21:35,350
and groceries on the ground?

526
00:21:38,030 --> 00:21:38,690
A desk lamp?

527
00:21:39,680 --> 00:21:41,340
Did you buy it for me and Qi Shi?

528
00:21:43,830 --> 00:21:45,030
A premium tea bottle.

529
00:21:47,110 --> 00:21:47,830
A gourd.

530
00:21:48,310 --> 00:21:48,720
Mom,

531
00:21:49,240 --> 00:21:50,500
why did you buy a gourd?

532
00:21:51,110 --> 00:21:51,880
Fine tea.

533
00:21:52,270 --> 00:21:53,130
Is it for my dad?

534
00:21:54,400 --> 00:21:54,750
Mom,

535
00:21:54,920 --> 00:21:57,050
I've also brought you something nice.

536
00:21:58,240 --> 00:22:00,170
There's a lot of bubble gum in here.

537
00:22:00,310 --> 00:22:01,510
I'm saving it all for Qi Shi.

538
00:22:01,510 --> 00:22:02,570
It's her favorite.

539
00:22:03,020 --> 00:22:03,880
And I got all this stuff

540
00:22:03,880 --> 00:22:05,280
from Cao Si this morning.

541
00:22:05,790 --> 00:22:07,000
Uncle Cao and his family are so nice,

542
00:22:07,000 --> 00:22:08,860
for giving us so many nice things.

543
00:22:08,960 --> 00:22:09,350
Mom,

544
00:22:09,640 --> 00:22:11,700
a piece of White Rabbit Candy for you.

545
00:22:14,070 --> 00:22:15,030
Mom, take it.

546
00:22:19,630 --> 00:22:20,790
Someone caused your father

547
00:22:20,790 --> 00:22:22,410
to lose his job.

548
00:22:22,440 --> 00:22:23,700
And now a few pieces of candy are enough

549
00:22:23,700 --> 00:22:24,610
to silence you.

550
00:22:24,790 --> 00:22:26,200
Mom, Mom!

551
00:22:26,550 --> 00:22:27,480
You think we want

552
00:22:27,510 --> 00:22:28,570
this junk from you?

553
00:22:29,200 --> 00:22:29,800
Qinglian,

554
00:22:30,350 --> 00:22:32,030
just say whatever you have to say.

555
00:22:32,030 --> 00:22:33,550
Why take it out on the child?

556
00:22:33,550 --> 00:22:34,270
I'm educating my child.

557
00:22:34,270 --> 00:22:35,350
It's none of your business.

558
00:22:35,350 --> 00:22:36,180
Stop embarrassing yourself.

559
00:22:36,180 --> 00:22:37,440
Go back into the house.

560
00:22:37,920 --> 00:22:38,980
I'm embarrassing?

561
00:22:39,240 --> 00:22:40,000
How so?

562
00:22:40,830 --> 00:22:42,240
I live an honest and upright life.

563
00:22:42,240 --> 00:22:44,480
A straight tree is not afraid of
crooked shadows.

564
00:22:44,480 --> 00:22:45,830
I'm different from some people

565
00:22:45,830 --> 00:22:46,830
who act like good friends

566
00:22:46,830 --> 00:22:48,020
on the surface

567
00:22:48,240 --> 00:22:48,970
and secretly

568
00:22:49,240 --> 00:22:50,570
stab others in the back.

569
00:22:50,880 --> 00:22:51,550
Cao Dongfang,

570
00:22:51,550 --> 00:22:53,210
let's make it all clear today.

571
00:22:53,960 --> 00:22:55,360
When everything is fine,

572
00:22:55,510 --> 00:22:56,240
you bring chicken soup

573
00:22:56,240 --> 00:22:57,640
and all sorts of things over.

574
00:22:57,640 --> 00:22:58,590
You talk a good game

575
00:22:58,590 --> 00:22:59,750
about us being a family.

576
00:22:59,750 --> 00:23:00,790
But when trouble arrives,

577
00:23:00,790 --> 00:23:02,120
you turn your back on us.

578
00:23:02,510 --> 00:23:03,270
We are so unlucky

579
00:23:03,270 --> 00:23:04,880
to be your neighbors.

580
00:23:07,030 --> 00:23:07,960
What's going on?

581
00:23:08,920 --> 00:23:10,550
-What is this about?
-Qinglian,

582
00:23:10,550 --> 00:23:12,130
what do you mean by that?

583
00:23:12,160 --> 00:23:13,010
What do I mean?

584
00:23:13,160 --> 00:23:14,070
I'd like everyone present

585
00:23:14,070 --> 00:23:14,930
to be a witness.

586
00:23:15,040 --> 00:23:16,230
From now on, the Cao and Qi families

587
00:23:16,230 --> 00:23:17,790
are strangers to each other!

588
00:23:17,790 --> 00:23:19,250
They used to be very close.

589
00:23:20,110 --> 00:23:21,770
Is there a misunderstanding?

590
00:23:23,790 --> 00:23:25,110
The quarrel is so intense.

591
00:23:25,110 --> 00:23:25,790
Yeah.

592
00:23:25,790 --> 00:23:26,750
Can't they clear up the misunderstanding?

593
00:23:26,750 --> 00:23:28,000
Why a fierce fight?

594
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:28,480
Yeah.\

595
00:23:28,720 --> 00:23:30,300
Never thought she'd be like this.

596
00:23:30,300 --> 00:23:31,360
Go home, all of you!

597
00:23:33,510 --> 00:23:35,170
Look how furious Qinglian is.

598
00:23:40,160 --> 00:23:41,790
Cao Si, don't cry.

599
00:23:42,750 --> 00:23:44,010
It's typical of my mom.

600
00:23:45,400 --> 00:23:46,830
All will be fine in time.

601
00:24:42,720 --> 00:24:44,580
How about dipping it in soy sauce?

602
00:24:44,920 --> 00:24:46,350
I'd like to dip it in sugar.

603
00:24:46,350 --> 00:24:47,510
Easy on the sugar.

604
00:24:47,920 --> 00:24:50,250
Eating too much of it
is bad for your teeth.

605
00:24:50,510 --> 00:24:52,310
I miss Mr. Cao's chicken soup.

606
00:24:53,270 --> 00:24:55,330
What do you think has gotten into Mom?

607
00:24:55,550 --> 00:24:56,680
She was so mad today.

608
00:24:57,200 --> 00:24:58,440
What if Cao Si and Cao Xin

609
00:24:58,440 --> 00:25:00,240
never talk to us anymore?

610
00:25:01,240 --> 00:25:03,040
I also want to have chicken soup.

611
00:25:03,930 --> 00:25:05,460
I already had a plan with Si.

612
00:25:06,160 --> 00:25:07,240
Tonight, she is supposed

613
00:25:07,240 --> 00:25:08,570
to teach me how to dance.

614
00:25:10,000 --> 00:25:10,510
Zhi,

615
00:25:11,310 --> 00:25:12,160
do you think

616
00:25:12,450 --> 00:25:13,550
Uncle Cao is the kind of person

617
00:25:13,550 --> 00:25:14,590
Mom says he is?

618
00:25:14,920 --> 00:25:15,750
I don't know.

619
00:25:17,700 --> 00:25:19,560
How about we sneak to their place?

620
00:25:19,810 --> 00:25:20,850
No, don't.

621
00:25:20,880 --> 00:25:22,200
Mom is still angry.

622
00:25:22,350 --> 00:25:23,750
Don't make things worse.

623
00:25:27,550 --> 00:25:28,590
Dad got laid off.

624
00:25:29,310 --> 00:25:30,110
In the future,

625
00:25:30,240 --> 00:25:31,790
we can't afford coal briquettes,

626
00:25:31,790 --> 00:25:33,590
and not even dry steamed buns.

627
00:25:34,790 --> 00:25:35,720
Let me tell you something.

628
00:25:35,720 --> 00:25:36,920
Today, both parents

629
00:25:37,680 --> 00:25:39,590
of a classmate of mine got laid off.

630
00:25:39,590 --> 00:25:41,680
Their entire family had to return
to their hometown.

631
00:25:41,680 --> 00:25:42,880
They cried miserably

632
00:25:43,240 --> 00:25:44,400
when they left.

633
00:25:44,830 --> 00:25:45,720
Several classmates of mine have

634
00:25:45,720 --> 00:25:47,450
transferred to other schools.

635
00:25:47,510 --> 00:25:49,200
Could it be for the same reason?

636
00:25:49,200 --> 00:25:50,400
Perhaps we'll also have to

637
00:25:50,400 --> 00:25:51,990
reside in the countryside one day.

638
00:25:51,990 --> 00:25:53,920
Then you won't be able to get a wife.

639
00:25:54,030 --> 00:25:54,950
Actually,

640
00:25:55,270 --> 00:25:56,200
Uncle Cao doesn't

641
00:25:56,200 --> 00:25:57,600
strike me as a bad person.

642
00:25:59,270 --> 00:26:02,110
But what Mom said today
isn't entirely wrong.

643
00:26:02,920 --> 00:26:04,450
Dad really did get laid off.

644
00:26:06,160 --> 00:26:07,890
To keep the peace of the family,

645
00:26:08,270 --> 00:26:10,480
we'll have to sever ties

646
00:26:10,510 --> 00:26:12,580
with Cao Si and Cao Xin.

647
00:26:26,110 --> 00:26:28,270
You haven't eaten anything all day.

648
00:26:28,680 --> 00:26:29,880
Grab a bite at least.

649
00:26:34,790 --> 00:26:35,610
About your job,

650
00:26:35,610 --> 00:26:37,280
we'll figure something out.

651
00:26:44,000 --> 00:26:44,750
Have a bite.

652
00:26:50,720 --> 00:26:52,680
It's just a layoff, come on.

653
00:26:52,680 --> 00:26:54,480
It's not like the sky has fallen.

654
00:26:56,400 --> 00:26:57,030
Even if it does,

655
00:26:57,030 --> 00:26:58,690
taller people will hold it up.

656
00:27:06,500 --> 00:27:08,950
You do have some skills.

657
00:27:11,440 --> 00:27:13,250
Good job fixing the brush.

658
00:27:13,310 --> 00:27:13,920
I mean it.

659
00:27:14,400 --> 00:27:15,510
The bristles were all worn out.

660
00:27:15,510 --> 00:27:16,590
I was going to throw it away.

661
00:27:16,590 --> 00:27:17,440
But after being repaired

662
00:27:17,440 --> 00:27:18,750
by you, it looks as good as new.

663
00:27:18,750 --> 00:27:19,480
This could easily

664
00:27:19,480 --> 00:27:20,130
sell for 50 or 80 cents

665
00:27:20,130 --> 00:27:21,330
in the market, right?

666
00:27:21,590 --> 00:27:24,050
You can't get this quality
for 50 or 80 cents.

667
00:27:24,200 --> 00:27:25,200
Two yuan then.

668
00:27:28,820 --> 00:27:29,480
How about this?

669
00:27:29,480 --> 00:27:31,140
Tomorrow, let's set up a stall

670
00:27:31,200 --> 00:27:32,230
in the market

671
00:27:32,550 --> 00:27:34,030
to sell the brushes and shovels

672
00:27:34,030 --> 00:27:34,750
you made.

673
00:27:34,770 --> 00:27:35,830
This stuff you made

674
00:27:36,320 --> 00:27:37,240
is much better than that

675
00:27:37,240 --> 00:27:38,640
in our department store.

676
00:27:38,640 --> 00:27:40,550
We can also buy some daily necessities

677
00:27:40,550 --> 00:27:42,080
and start a small business.

678
00:27:42,240 --> 00:27:44,400
There's always a way out, right?

679
00:27:45,310 --> 00:27:45,770
Come on.

680
00:27:46,750 --> 00:27:47,200
Eat up.

681
00:27:50,400 --> 00:27:50,860
Come on.

682
00:27:53,640 --> 00:27:54,170
I'll eat.

683
00:27:56,020 --> 00:27:57,370
There is always

684
00:27:57,400 --> 00:27:58,030
a way out.

685
00:28:15,110 --> 00:28:15,710
Dongfang.

686
00:28:16,230 --> 00:28:16,830
Dongfang!

687
00:28:17,880 --> 00:28:18,440
Dad.

688
00:28:18,790 --> 00:28:19,850
I'm thinking about

689
00:28:19,880 --> 00:28:21,940
taking our money out of this bankbook

690
00:28:22,270 --> 00:28:24,110
and giving it to Aihua and his family.

691
00:28:24,110 --> 00:28:26,170
On this matter, we're in the wrong.

692
00:28:26,920 --> 00:28:28,320
Things have gotten so bad

693
00:28:28,680 --> 00:28:30,240
that they won't accept our money.

694
00:28:30,240 --> 00:28:30,920
Forget it.

695
00:28:44,550 --> 00:28:45,510
Si,

696
00:28:46,160 --> 00:28:48,000
will Qi Zhi

697
00:28:48,400 --> 00:28:49,640
and Qi Shi never

698
00:28:50,510 --> 00:28:51,310
talk to us again?

699
00:28:51,310 --> 00:28:52,750
What do you think?

700
00:29:06,350 --> 00:29:08,310
Si, stop crying.

701
00:29:08,310 --> 00:29:09,440
I'm not crying.

702
00:29:49,510 --> 00:29:50,110
Uncle C...

703
00:29:55,350 --> 00:29:56,550
Cao Xin, you're back.

704
00:29:56,880 --> 00:29:57,400
Cao Xin!

705
00:29:58,070 --> 00:29:58,750
Come over.

706
00:29:58,780 --> 00:29:59,880
Wait here for a bit.

707
00:30:03,160 --> 00:30:03,890
Here you are.

708
00:30:04,350 --> 00:30:05,680
You must be hungry, huh?

709
00:30:08,350 --> 00:30:10,280
Do they not feed you enough at home?

710
00:30:10,400 --> 00:30:11,800
Take these home with you.

711
00:30:12,310 --> 00:30:14,400
Don't tell your grandpa
or your dad, though.

712
00:30:14,400 --> 00:30:14,790
Okay.

713
00:30:15,310 --> 00:30:17,160
Wash your hands. Dinner's ready.

714
00:30:17,160 --> 00:30:17,510
Go.

715
00:30:32,680 --> 00:30:34,150
We can solve the problem this way.

716
00:30:34,150 --> 00:30:34,930
Split 360

717
00:30:34,960 --> 00:30:36,510
into two numbers

718
00:30:36,720 --> 00:30:38,270
of 190

719
00:30:38,680 --> 00:30:39,350
and 170.

720
00:30:39,830 --> 00:30:40,270
Then,

721
00:30:40,270 --> 00:30:41,640
170 minus 70

722
00:30:42,030 --> 00:30:43,510
gives a round number,

723
00:30:44,030 --> 00:30:45,240
namely 100, right?

724
00:31:13,000 --> 00:31:13,590
Ma'am,

725
00:31:13,830 --> 00:31:14,830
why isn't the 2 p.m. bus

726
00:31:14,830 --> 00:31:15,760
to Haizhou here?

727
00:31:16,510 --> 00:31:17,400
That bus was full,

728
00:31:17,400 --> 00:31:18,480
so it left early.

729
00:31:19,160 --> 00:31:19,880
When?

730
00:31:20,220 --> 00:31:21,350
About 5 minutes ago.

731
00:31:39,540 --> 00:31:42,120
♪ Countless times I broke the rules ♪

732
00:31:43,160 --> 00:31:46,910
♪ Countless times I longed to break free ♪

733
00:31:47,590 --> 00:31:49,650
♪ I loudly laughed, mocked,
expressed anger, and yelled ♪

734
00:31:50,100 --> 00:31:55,400
♪ Then I realized I missed you dearly ♪

735
00:31:54,340 --> 00:31:55,470
Cao Si! Cao Si!

736
00:31:56,770 --> 00:31:59,550
♪ Countless times I searched for answers ♪

737
00:31:57,070 --> 00:31:57,720
Cao Si!

738
00:32:00,160 --> 00:32:01,790
Did you run here from the bus station?

739
00:32:00,460 --> 00:32:03,850
♪ Would I be better off
if I lived a different life ♪

740
00:32:02,310 --> 00:32:02,880
Cao Si,

741
00:32:03,790 --> 00:32:05,030
why go to the provincial capital?

742
00:32:04,560 --> 00:32:06,620
♪ But it turns out living in one's prime ♪

743
00:32:05,350 --> 00:32:07,200
I'm heading there to learn dancing.

744
00:32:07,200 --> 00:32:08,310
My dad wouldn't let me tell you.

745
00:32:07,770 --> 00:32:09,700
♪ Just means ♪

746
00:32:08,480 --> 00:32:09,970
The provincial city is great.

747
00:32:09,970 --> 00:32:17,090
♪ That we can set out together ♪

748
00:32:10,240 --> 00:32:11,700
When will you be back then?

749
00:32:11,920 --> 00:32:12,680
I'm not sure yet.

750
00:32:12,680 --> 00:32:13,740
When you get there,

751
00:32:14,350 --> 00:32:15,640
write to me, will you?

752
00:32:16,310 --> 00:32:17,000
I'll be waiting.

753
00:32:17,000 --> 00:32:17,440
Okay.

754
00:32:18,650 --> 00:32:20,870
♪ An old sofa ♪

755
00:32:20,200 --> 00:32:21,660
Do remember to write to me.

756
00:32:22,960 --> 00:32:23,590
The bus is leaving.

757
00:32:23,020 --> 00:32:25,980
♪ A group photo
and several pots of flowers ♪

758
00:32:24,160 --> 00:32:25,160
Head back inside.

759
00:32:26,270 --> 00:32:27,290
Don't forget what I said.

760
00:32:26,900 --> 00:32:28,930
♪ A few words of everyday talk ♪

761
00:32:27,720 --> 00:32:29,180
Do remember to write to me!

762
00:32:29,520 --> 00:32:34,160
♪ I wish time could stop right now ♪

763
00:32:30,920 --> 00:32:31,720
Cao Si,

764
00:32:32,000 --> 00:32:34,680
don't forget to write to me!

765
00:32:35,070 --> 00:32:36,640
Goodbye, Cao Si!

766
00:32:35,850 --> 00:32:38,800
♪ The revolving winters and summers ♪

767
00:32:37,270 --> 00:32:38,680
Goodbye!

768
00:32:40,230 --> 00:32:42,830
♪ I grew up in the midst of chaos ♪

769
00:32:43,510 --> 00:32:44,400
Cao Si!

770
00:32:44,440 --> 00:32:46,420
♪ The world is full of changes ♪

771
00:32:44,590 --> 00:32:46,070
Bye bye!

772
00:32:46,770 --> 00:32:53,320
♪ With the door closed,
I'm back to the old days ♪

773
00:32:50,720 --> 00:32:51,590
That kid is

774
00:32:52,200 --> 00:32:53,330
quite a good runner.

775
00:32:53,700 --> 00:32:56,270
♪ Countless times I broke the rules ♪

776
00:32:54,270 --> 00:32:55,600
He's a natural athlete.

777
00:32:57,310 --> 00:33:01,070
♪ Countless times I longed to break free ♪

778
00:33:01,740 --> 00:33:03,810
♪ I loudly laughed, mocked,
expressed anger, and yelled ♪

779
00:33:04,260 --> 00:33:09,560
♪ Then I realized I missed you dearly ♪

780
00:33:10,920 --> 00:33:13,700
♪ Countless times I searched for answers ♪

781
00:33:11,440 --> 00:33:11,880
Hey,

782
00:33:11,960 --> 00:33:12,830
here's chicken soup.

783
00:33:12,830 --> 00:33:14,090
I happen to be thirsty.

784
00:33:14,610 --> 00:33:18,010
♪ Would I be better off
if I lived a different life ♪

785
00:33:15,070 --> 00:33:16,600
Slow down. Or you'll choke.

786
00:33:18,720 --> 00:33:20,780
♪ But it turns out living in one's prime ♪

787
00:33:20,920 --> 00:33:21,450
Later on,

788
00:33:21,590 --> 00:33:23,030
have Qi Shi come here.

789
00:33:21,920 --> 00:33:23,850
♪ Just means ♪

790
00:33:23,310 --> 00:33:24,510
This bowl is for her.

791
00:33:24,130 --> 00:33:31,250
♪ That we can set out together ♪

792
00:33:24,920 --> 00:33:26,480
Forget it. Qi Shi won't drink it.

793
00:33:26,480 --> 00:33:27,680
She'll even tattletale to my mom.

794
00:33:27,680 --> 00:33:29,000
It's better to stay out of trouble.

795
00:33:29,000 --> 00:33:30,330
I'll have this bowl too.

796
00:33:57,460 --> 00:33:59,410
[The 6th-grade final exam results
of Qingwu Central Elementary School]

797
00:33:59,410 --> 00:34:01,360
[No. 1: Cao Xin]
[No. 2: Qi Shi]

798
00:34:01,570 --> 00:34:03,030
[The 7th-grade final exam ranking
of Qingwu Middle School]

799
00:34:03,030 --> 00:34:04,490
[No. 1: Cao Xin]
[No. 2: Qi Shi]

800
00:34:05,270 --> 00:34:06,640
[The 9th-grade final exam ranking
of Qingwu Middle School]

801
00:34:06,640 --> 00:34:08,010
[No. 1: Qi Shi]
[No. 2: Cao Xin]

802
00:34:08,560 --> 00:34:09,909
[The 11th-grade monthly exam ranking
of Qingwu High School]

803
00:34:09,909 --> 00:34:11,270
[No. 1: Cao Xin]
[No. 2: Qi Shi]

804
00:34:11,510 --> 00:34:12,880
Pack five buns for me.

805
00:34:13,280 --> 00:34:13,760
Sure.

806
00:34:16,150 --> 00:34:17,810
All with vegetable fillings?

807
00:34:18,510 --> 00:34:20,230
I'd like two as well.

808
00:34:21,190 --> 00:34:22,230
Qinglian!

809
00:34:22,630 --> 00:34:23,440
It's been a while

810
00:34:23,440 --> 00:34:24,320
since I last saw you.

811
00:34:24,320 --> 00:34:25,840
Yeah. Buying buns?

812
00:34:26,230 --> 00:34:26,760
How about I get you two?

813
00:34:26,760 --> 00:34:27,190
No need.

814
00:34:27,190 --> 00:34:28,510
I've had breakfast.

815
00:34:28,920 --> 00:34:30,000
The buns look pretty nice.

816
00:34:30,000 --> 00:34:31,530
You're carrying many bags.

817
00:34:31,550 --> 00:34:33,070
You bought so much food.

818
00:34:33,139 --> 00:34:34,800
My son's coming home tonight.

819
00:34:35,230 --> 00:34:36,230
That explains it.

820
00:34:37,150 --> 00:34:38,340
You're so lucky.

821
00:34:38,710 --> 00:34:39,909
Of your two children,

822
00:34:40,070 --> 00:34:41,800
one always ranks first in exams,

823
00:34:41,800 --> 00:34:44,000
and the other got into
the provincial sports school.

824
00:34:44,000 --> 00:34:44,920
You don't have to

825
00:34:44,920 --> 00:34:45,960
worry about them at all.

826
00:34:45,960 --> 00:34:48,090
You haven't aged a bit all these years.

827
00:34:48,230 --> 00:34:49,480
Easy for you to say.

828
00:34:49,510 --> 00:34:50,380
You guys just never saw

829
00:34:50,380 --> 00:34:52,040
the hard times I went through.

830
00:34:52,710 --> 00:34:53,480
I did.

831
00:34:53,550 --> 00:34:55,280
It's all fine
now that you've made it through.

832
00:34:55,280 --> 00:34:56,320
Your daughter, Qi Shi,

833
00:34:56,320 --> 00:34:56,920
will probably

834
00:34:56,920 --> 00:34:59,110
be the top scorer
in the college entrance exam.

835
00:34:59,110 --> 00:34:59,840
And your son, Qi Zhi,

836
00:34:59,840 --> 00:35:01,640
might win an Olympic gold medal.

837
00:35:01,840 --> 00:35:03,440
Then your family will move up
in the world.

838
00:35:03,440 --> 00:35:04,190
From your lips to God's ears.

839
00:35:04,190 --> 00:35:05,760
I'll host a big banquet if that happens.

840
00:35:05,760 --> 00:35:06,710
I'll be waiting then.

841
00:35:06,710 --> 00:35:07,110
Okay.

842
00:35:07,800 --> 00:35:09,600
Qinglian, a look at the clothes?

843
00:35:09,710 --> 00:35:10,590
This jacket seems good.

844
00:35:10,590 --> 00:35:11,190
Qinglian.

845
00:35:11,480 --> 00:35:12,340
Do you remember

846
00:35:12,510 --> 00:35:12,880
the department store

847
00:35:12,880 --> 00:35:13,920
we used to work at?

848
00:35:14,280 --> 00:35:15,230
It's been torn down.

849
00:35:15,230 --> 00:35:16,110
I went for a visit.

850
00:35:16,110 --> 00:35:17,710
There stands a commercial building now.

851
00:35:17,710 --> 00:35:18,760
It's so grand.

852
00:35:18,960 --> 00:35:20,590
The clothes in there... How...

853
00:35:20,590 --> 00:35:21,520
How much is this?

854
00:35:22,280 --> 00:35:23,010
Ninety yuan.

855
00:35:23,190 --> 00:35:24,230
-That expensive?
-Ninety?

856
00:35:24,230 --> 00:35:25,560
This is made for export.

857
00:35:27,190 --> 00:35:28,080
We'll browse around.

858
00:35:28,080 --> 00:35:28,590
At that place,

859
00:35:28,590 --> 00:35:30,360
a random piece of clothing costs
over a hundred.

860
00:35:30,360 --> 00:35:31,220
How expensive.

861
00:35:31,330 --> 00:35:32,400
Those days of easy living

862
00:35:32,400 --> 00:35:33,410
are gone now.

863
00:35:33,440 --> 00:35:35,400
Everyone has to rely on themselves.

864
00:35:35,400 --> 00:35:37,030
Your husband Aihua is an exception.

865
00:35:37,030 --> 00:35:38,280
He seized the opportunity

866
00:35:38,280 --> 00:35:40,190
and got a stall here. How very nice.

867
00:35:40,190 --> 00:35:41,230
But my husband,

868
00:35:41,410 --> 00:35:42,810
can't do this at all.

869
00:35:42,840 --> 00:35:44,030
The entire household depends on him.

870
00:35:44,030 --> 00:35:45,760
We're all the same, struggling to get by.

871
00:35:45,760 --> 00:35:46,710
Alright. I'm leaving then.

872
00:35:46,710 --> 00:35:47,110
Okay.

873
00:35:47,320 --> 00:35:48,230
I have to mind the stall now.

874
00:35:48,230 --> 00:35:49,320
That earpick seems good.

875
00:35:49,320 --> 00:35:49,880
Why not throw one in for free?

876
00:35:49,880 --> 00:35:51,070
I've bought so many things from you.

877
00:35:51,070 --> 00:35:52,150
Just throw in a free gift.

878
00:35:52,150 --> 00:35:52,550
Fine.

879
00:35:52,800 --> 00:35:54,000
Since you're a regular,

880
00:35:54,000 --> 00:35:54,590
a free earpick for you.

881
00:35:54,590 --> 00:35:55,440
Okay. Good.

882
00:35:56,400 --> 00:35:57,730
Does this fan work well?

883
00:35:58,050 --> 00:35:58,560
It does.

884
00:35:58,590 --> 00:35:59,440
It's a palm-leaf fan.

885
00:35:59,440 --> 00:36:00,190
How about this?

886
00:36:00,190 --> 00:36:01,230
Let me take it home and try it out.

887
00:36:01,230 --> 00:36:02,490
I'll pay you tomorrow.

888
00:36:03,230 --> 00:36:03,670
Okay.

889
00:36:04,050 --> 00:36:04,700
Hold on!

890
00:36:07,190 --> 00:36:07,850
Th-This...

891
00:36:08,190 --> 00:36:08,670
You...

892
00:36:09,880 --> 00:36:11,590
Which of these things did he pay for?

893
00:36:11,590 --> 00:36:12,680
I bought this.

894
00:36:12,710 --> 00:36:14,040
Which one did he pay for?

895
00:36:14,550 --> 00:36:15,080
The soap.

896
00:36:17,000 --> 00:36:17,400
Wait.

897
00:36:17,560 --> 00:36:19,150
Didn't he say it was free of charge?

898
00:36:19,150 --> 00:36:20,530
Penny wise, pound foolish.

899
00:36:20,530 --> 00:36:21,190
Do you know?

900
00:36:21,670 --> 00:36:22,670
How could you do business this way?

901
00:36:22,670 --> 00:36:23,840
This is exactly the way I do business.

902
00:36:23,840 --> 00:36:25,030
Will you leave or not?

903
00:36:25,030 --> 00:36:25,550
It...

904
00:36:28,370 --> 00:36:29,360
He only bought one bar of soap.

905
00:36:29,360 --> 00:36:31,560
Why not give him everything at our home?

906
00:36:31,680 --> 00:36:32,840
At this rate, our business

907
00:36:32,840 --> 00:36:34,300
will eventually go south.

908
00:36:34,320 --> 00:36:35,360
Don't you think our family is poor

909
00:36:35,360 --> 00:36:35,820
enough?

910
00:36:38,200 --> 00:36:39,110
Alright, let's go home

911
00:36:39,110 --> 00:36:40,800
i-if you don't want to run the stall.

912
00:36:40,800 --> 00:36:42,530
Our son's coming home tonight.

913
00:36:43,550 --> 00:36:44,880
Okay. I'll pack up then.

914
00:37:01,760 --> 00:37:02,570
Mr. Cao.

915
00:37:02,920 --> 00:37:03,680
Mr. Cao!

916
00:37:07,130 --> 00:37:08,280
Look at your chicken.

917
00:37:08,280 --> 00:37:09,810
Instead of staying in your own yard,

918
00:37:09,810 --> 00:37:11,360
it constantly comes to my place

919
00:37:11,360 --> 00:37:12,680
and ruins my vegetables.

920
00:37:12,680 --> 00:37:13,400
Why don't you

921
00:37:13,400 --> 00:37:14,400
just give it to me?

922
00:37:14,600 --> 00:37:15,930
I'll either stew it

923
00:37:15,960 --> 00:37:16,790
or braise it.

924
00:37:18,110 --> 00:37:18,690
You see...

925
00:37:18,690 --> 00:37:20,070
Listen to yourself.

926
00:37:20,280 --> 00:37:21,710
Don't be so mean.

927
00:37:22,090 --> 00:37:23,400
It's just a little chicken.

928
00:37:23,400 --> 00:37:24,920
Why get mad at it at all?

929
00:37:25,510 --> 00:37:27,070
Fine, you can have it.

930
00:37:27,670 --> 00:37:29,270
But do you know how to cook it?

931
00:37:29,710 --> 00:37:31,460
Your daughter's in her second year
of high school now.

932
00:37:31,460 --> 00:37:32,960
She needs plenty of nutrition.

933
00:37:32,960 --> 00:37:34,150
She's my own daughter.

934
00:37:34,150 --> 00:37:35,280
I know how to take care of her.

935
00:37:35,280 --> 00:37:36,360
I don't need your tutoring.

936
00:37:36,360 --> 00:37:37,220
I know. I get it.

937
00:37:37,840 --> 00:37:38,670
Mom, Mom.

938
00:37:38,690 --> 00:37:39,420
It h-hurts.

939
00:37:39,450 --> 00:37:40,760
I'm having a cramp again.

940
00:37:40,760 --> 00:37:41,630
A-A cramp?

941
00:37:41,880 --> 00:37:43,080
Did you run back here?

942
00:37:43,570 --> 00:37:44,760
How many times have I told you

943
00:37:44,760 --> 00:37:46,000
to take a bus?

944
00:37:46,440 --> 00:37:47,630
We can afford the fees.

945
00:37:47,630 --> 00:37:49,890
It hurts. It really hurts. Give me a hand.

946
00:37:49,920 --> 00:37:51,550
It's dusty here near the mine.

947
00:37:51,550 --> 00:37:52,710
Look at your neck, covered

948
00:37:52,710 --> 00:37:54,440
in dust due to all that running.

949
00:37:54,440 --> 00:37:55,550
Mom, help me. Mom.

950
00:37:55,550 --> 00:37:56,750
It really hurts a lot.

951
00:37:57,890 --> 00:37:58,810
The chicken!

952
00:37:58,840 --> 00:38:00,170
I'm in so much pain, Mom.

953
00:38:00,230 --> 00:38:01,360
We are already home.

954
00:38:01,400 --> 00:38:02,200
Hang in there.

955
00:38:04,760 --> 00:38:06,480
Come on. Come home with me.

956
00:38:06,760 --> 00:38:08,150
Don't you wander off again.

957
00:38:08,150 --> 00:38:09,030
Let's go home.

958
00:38:40,480 --> 00:38:41,960
Dinner's ready.

959
00:38:42,670 --> 00:38:44,030
There are two grown men in the house,

960
00:38:44,030 --> 00:38:45,960
yet neither of you offers to serve.

961
00:38:46,480 --> 00:38:47,960
All the chores at home are mine.

962
00:38:47,960 --> 00:38:49,110
Don't fight me for it.

963
00:38:49,110 --> 00:38:49,760
Dad, let me do it.

964
00:38:49,760 --> 00:38:50,800
I rarely come home.

965
00:38:50,800 --> 00:38:51,630
I will do it. I will.

966
00:38:51,630 --> 00:38:52,150
You two

967
00:38:52,170 --> 00:38:53,300
drop the act now.

968
00:38:53,440 --> 00:38:54,630
Neither of you can be counted on.

969
00:38:54,630 --> 00:38:56,160
I'll serve the food myself.

970
00:38:59,400 --> 00:39:00,710
Look at the fish your mom cooked.

971
00:39:00,710 --> 00:39:01,800
It smells so good.

972
00:39:03,440 --> 00:39:04,170
Take a sniff.

973
00:39:04,960 --> 00:39:05,560
Am I right?

974
00:39:05,670 --> 00:39:06,110
Yes.

975
00:39:07,440 --> 00:39:09,860
The only thing missing is cilantro, right?

976
00:39:10,670 --> 00:39:11,730
I'll go pluck some.

977
00:39:12,070 --> 00:39:13,670
Taking a stroll, aren't you?

978
00:39:14,190 --> 00:39:14,920
Grandpa,

979
00:39:14,940 --> 00:39:15,710
I'm back.

980
00:39:16,230 --> 00:39:17,430
Taking a stroll, huh?

981
00:39:17,440 --> 00:39:18,640
Are you going to work?

982
00:39:18,880 --> 00:39:20,080
I am already off work.

983
00:39:20,560 --> 00:39:21,560
How do you know

984
00:39:21,590 --> 00:39:22,480
I love walnut cookies?

985
00:39:22,480 --> 00:39:23,550
Of course I do.

986
00:39:23,770 --> 00:39:24,150
Let's go.

987
00:39:24,150 --> 00:39:25,410
Come in and take a seat.

988
00:39:26,760 --> 00:39:28,020
It's from the factory.

989
00:39:28,230 --> 00:39:29,590
I'm done exercising.
Let me get some water.

990
00:39:29,590 --> 00:39:30,250
Got it, Dad.

991
00:39:31,960 --> 00:39:33,160
He's confused again.

992
00:39:33,480 --> 00:39:34,840
And you squandered money again.

993
00:39:34,840 --> 00:39:36,000
You don't earn much.

994
00:39:36,480 --> 00:39:37,690
How can you be a squanderer?

995
00:39:37,690 --> 00:39:39,550
I just bought these on my way home.

996
00:39:39,880 --> 00:39:40,510
Don't you enjoy

997
00:39:40,510 --> 00:39:41,230
walnut cookies?

998
00:39:41,230 --> 00:39:43,690
That doesn't mean
you get to squander money.

999
00:39:45,110 --> 00:39:46,480
There's no cilantro here.

1000
00:39:46,480 --> 00:39:47,190
In that case,

1001
00:39:47,190 --> 00:39:48,510
go out to buy some!

1002
00:39:48,920 --> 00:39:50,710
Stop taking things from others
all the time.

1003
00:39:50,710 --> 00:39:52,170
Or they'll whine about it.

1004
00:40:05,540 --> 00:40:07,670
Mom, I'm going out to buy cilantro now.

1005
00:40:16,800 --> 00:40:17,360
Si!

1006
00:40:18,630 --> 00:40:19,230
Come here.

1007
00:40:20,230 --> 00:40:20,590
Dad.

1008
00:40:24,150 --> 00:40:25,550
Mom, I bought cilantro.

1009
00:40:26,760 --> 00:40:28,030
Don't you say I'm a martial arts champion?

1010
00:40:28,030 --> 00:40:29,890
I practice running, so I run fast.

1011
00:40:31,000 --> 00:40:32,200
Wash it up and chop it.

1012
00:40:33,360 --> 00:40:33,880
Okay.

1013
00:40:34,840 --> 00:40:35,400
Come back!

1014
00:40:35,400 --> 00:40:36,400
What is it, honey?

1015
00:40:37,070 --> 00:40:38,800
Tell Qi Shi to come have dinner.

1016
00:40:38,880 --> 00:40:39,230
Okay.

1017
00:40:40,440 --> 00:40:41,040
Sweetie,

1018
00:40:42,070 --> 00:40:43,000
time for dinner!

1019
00:40:43,550 --> 00:40:44,480
Coming right up.

1020
00:40:44,960 --> 00:40:46,480
She does zero chores all day long

1021
00:40:46,480 --> 00:40:48,640
and never comes to eat
when it's meal time.

1022
00:40:48,640 --> 00:40:49,550
Shi would love to do chores,

1023
00:40:49,550 --> 00:40:50,750
but you won't let her.

1024
00:40:51,200 --> 00:40:52,480
You think we're so rich that she gets

1025
00:40:52,480 --> 00:40:53,390
to ruin everything?

1026
00:40:53,390 --> 00:40:55,840
She drops a plate
every time she carries one.

1027
00:40:55,840 --> 00:40:56,360
Dad,

1028
00:40:56,670 --> 00:40:57,840
keep spoiling him

1029
00:40:58,230 --> 00:40:59,830
and sparing him from chores.

1030
00:41:00,050 --> 00:41:00,930
He has to study.

1031
00:41:01,030 --> 00:41:02,090
That matters most.

1032
00:41:03,760 --> 00:41:05,790
College boy, come out for dinner.

1033
00:41:06,630 --> 00:41:07,880
Don't distract him.

1034
00:41:08,880 --> 00:41:09,800
Cao Xin, come here.

1035
00:41:09,800 --> 00:41:10,260
Come on.

1036
00:41:10,710 --> 00:41:12,030
Take these to your room. Eat them.

1037
00:41:12,030 --> 00:41:12,710
Grab a few bites.

1038
00:41:12,710 --> 00:41:13,550
I'll go buy some more food.

1039
00:41:13,550 --> 00:41:13,950
But...

1040
00:41:14,230 --> 00:41:15,510
Get back to your studies.

1041
00:41:15,510 --> 00:41:16,000
Dad,

1042
00:41:16,360 --> 00:41:17,670
stop pushing him.

1043
00:41:17,920 --> 00:41:19,360
His grades are great now.

1044
00:41:19,970 --> 00:41:21,850
I'm sure he can get into a college.

1045
00:41:23,000 --> 00:41:24,410
Not only does he have to go to college,

1046
00:41:24,410 --> 00:41:26,150
but he also has to study a good major

1047
00:41:26,150 --> 00:41:27,150
in a good college.

1048
00:41:27,920 --> 00:41:28,550
In the future,

1049
00:41:28,550 --> 00:41:29,880
he'll have to apply for graduate school

1050
00:41:29,880 --> 00:41:32,210
and become a useful person to the society.

1051
00:41:34,280 --> 00:41:34,840
Grandpa,

1052
00:41:35,230 --> 00:41:36,630
let's have dinner first.

1053
00:41:37,320 --> 00:41:38,550
Careful.

1054
00:41:40,840 --> 00:41:42,230
Aren't we having walnut cookies?

1055
00:41:42,230 --> 00:41:43,760
Dad gave them all to Cao Xin.

1056
00:41:57,060 --> 00:41:58,120
Go get chopsticks.

1057
00:42:08,980 --> 00:42:09,760
Our family has

1058
00:42:09,760 --> 00:42:11,090
a martial arts champion

1059
00:42:12,710 --> 00:42:14,110
and a literary champion.

1060
00:42:18,840 --> 00:42:19,700
I say, Sweetie,

1061
00:42:20,920 --> 00:42:22,480
work hard on your studies.

1062
00:42:22,710 --> 00:42:24,760
By getting into Beining University,

1063
00:42:24,760 --> 00:42:26,090
you'll bring honor to me

1064
00:42:26,190 --> 00:42:27,440
and your mom.

1065
00:42:28,320 --> 00:42:30,670
Whether I can get into
Beining University aside,

1066
00:42:30,670 --> 00:42:31,450
I am sure I will do

1067
00:42:31,450 --> 00:42:32,750
better than Cao Xin in the exam,

1068
00:42:32,750 --> 00:42:33,880
who lives next door.

1069
00:42:34,710 --> 00:42:35,110
Right.

1070
00:42:36,280 --> 00:42:37,590
I won't force you to get into

1071
00:42:37,590 --> 00:42:38,320
college.

1072
00:42:39,030 --> 00:42:39,840
Most importantly,

1073
00:42:39,840 --> 00:42:40,960
you must master a skill

1074
00:42:40,960 --> 00:42:42,560
so you can support yourself.

1075
00:42:45,440 --> 00:42:45,760
Here,

1076
00:42:45,760 --> 00:42:46,620
have some fish.

1077
00:42:46,890 --> 00:42:47,590
I already picked out

1078
00:42:47,590 --> 00:42:48,700
the bones for you.

1079
00:42:52,670 --> 00:42:54,320
Some shredded potatoes for you.

1080
00:42:54,320 --> 00:42:55,050
Thanks, Zhi.

1081
00:42:56,800 --> 00:42:58,150
Your mom's cooking is really good.

1082
00:42:58,150 --> 00:42:58,550
Right?

1083
00:42:58,670 --> 00:42:59,270
Am I right?

1084
00:42:59,400 --> 00:42:59,880
Yes, so tasty.
